# Phaser 4

- Use Phaser **4.2.x** APIs. Ignore Phaser 3 pipeline/FX/Matter examples.
- Before using an unfamiliar Phaser API, read `node_modules/phaser/skills/` (especially `v4-new-features` and `v3-to-v4-migration`).
- Force `Phaser.WEBGL`. SpriteGPULayer does not run on Canvas.
- Filters/blend modes on every projectile break batching. Keep them off swarms.
- Pixel art: power-of-two textures, `pixelArt: true`.
- `this.add.spriteGPULayer(texture, size)` — one texture, not an atlas.

```ts
// BAD — Phaser 3 habit
this.cameras.main.setPipeline('...')
sprite.preFX.addGlow()

// GOOD
this.add.spriteGPULayer('dot', 20_000)
```
